import fckt.checker.diagnostics.Abandoning
import fckt.checker.types.Solving

// What working out an expression's type does: it solves unknowns, gives up at an error, does what
// the code it's checking does, so that the function or lambda around it does too, and hands on
// each when to be checked for covering every value; and notes what it finds, for tools.
@Solving @Abandoning @Doing @Covering @Noting annotation type Inferring
